{
  "id": "p29",
  "title": "The Club Anniversary Match",
  "titleZh": "俱乐部周年赛",
  "topic": "足球俱乐部周年",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Our soccer club celebrates its anniversary at the old stadium.",
        "zh": "我们的足球俱乐部在老体育场庆祝周年。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The city authority and a local firm will share the whole cost.",
        "zh": "市政府和一家本地公司将分担全部费用。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My uncle says the vast hall can contain a thousand fans.",
        "zh": "我叔叔说这个巨大的大厅能容纳一千名球迷。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My cousin knows ticket sales are the basis of every customer promise.",
        "zh": "我表亲知道门票销售是每位顾客承诺的基础。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A few extra helpers perform small tasks before the noon whistle.",
        "zh": "几个额外帮手在中午哨响前做些小任务。"
      },
      {
        "en": "From this distance, the judge can still see the white line.",
        "zh": "从这个距离，裁判仍能看见白线。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A noisy crowd may destroy the calm mood of the match.",
        "zh": "吵闹的人群可能会破坏比赛的平静气氛。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Meanwhile, a tough and sudden decision waits for the club board.",
        "zh": "与此同时，一个艰难而突然的决定等着俱乐部董事会。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later the busy schedule leaves little room for a costly arrangement.",
        "zh": "后来，繁忙的日程让一个昂贵的安排几乎没有空间。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They hope to acquire a young star and select a coach.",
        "zh": "他们希望签下一名年轻球星，并挑选一位教练。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "After the match, the small pub fills with quiet tension.",
        "zh": "比赛结束后，小酒馆里充满了安静的紧张。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My mother's voluntary work brings a mixture of joy and worry.",
        "zh": "我母亲的志愿工作带来了欢乐与担忧的混合。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A whisper about free ice cream makes the children smile.",
        "zh": "一句关于免费冰淇淋的低语让孩子们笑了。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then an extraordinary goal makes the whole bench react.",
        "zh": "然后一个精彩的进球让整条替补席都激动起来。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A strange plot makes a curious young reporter ask questions.",
        "zh": "一个奇怪的阴谋让一位好奇的年轻记者发问。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A recent graduate will sponsor the youth team this year.",
        "zh": "一位应届毕业生今年将赞助青年队。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The plan will involve every resource the small club owns.",
        "zh": "这个计划将动用俱乐部拥有的每一份资源。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This happy occasion brings an old rival to the main gate.",
        "zh": "这个欢乐的场合把一位老对手带到了大门前。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A map will illustrate the distribution of free tickets online.",
        "zh": "一张地图将展示免费门票的在线分发情况。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The notion that money solves all problems rarely holds true.",
        "zh": "认为钱能解决一切问题的观念很少成立。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "A new surgery is increasingly seen as a bright prospect.",
        "zh": "一家新诊所越来越被视为光明的前景。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later they invest in a program that fights local poverty.",
        "zh": "后来他们投资于一个抗击当地贫困的项目。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The tide of support may drift toward the away side.",
        "zh": "支持的风潮可能漂向客队一方。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We will never surrender to the old evil of cheating.",
        "zh": "我们永远不会向作弊这种古老的邪恶投降。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Media coverage of the short cruise grows every day.",
        "zh": "媒体对这趟短途游轮的报道每天都在增加。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The nineteenth match feels equivalent to a small final.",
        "zh": "第十九场比赛感觉相当于一场小型决赛。"
      },
      {
        "en": "An environmental alliance meets its foreign counterpart in town.",
        "zh": "一个环保联盟在镇上会见了它的外国同行。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Every satisfied fan wears a bright new jersey.",
        "zh": "每位满意的球迷都穿着崭新的球衣。"
      }
    ]
  ],
